<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-10</name><desc>H-10 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It's 4.2 km from below Lubanishta (696 m) to near Trpejca, with about 167 m of climbing and 133 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 696 m and 867 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-10/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
